      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=168s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "at our scale, we have thousands of repositories and it really is a backlog that never empties and you close 10 issues today and you know next week 20 more will arrive",
