      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=52s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "So, you don't really have a like a patching problem, you also have like a reasoning problem that you um need to address here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 129,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
