      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=248s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It shouldn't just, you know, bump the dependencies to the latest and greatest version. That's just that interest introduces unnecessary risk, which we want to avoid.",
      "timestamp_sec": 367,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=367s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the CVE remediation agent actually just modifies files on the file system. It doesn't commit, it doesn't push, it doesn't create a PR, it doesn't watch the CI itself.",
      "timestamp_sec": 367,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=367s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It kind of LLMs LLMs kind of tend to just revert the previous changes that it did. So, we got to tell it to not do this.",
      "timestamp_sec": 447,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=447s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "at the end of every agent invocation, we ask the agent to do a very short and simple retrospective. What went well, what went wrong, what tools are missing, and what kind of context would help the next time it would be invoked.",
      "timestamp_sec": 486,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
