      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LqLoYksJ6do&t=713s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "there was like 70,000 lines of code that were changed in that small PR. Um that's really like a lot of changes that come in just by bumping a couple of dependencies.",
