      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "there um, unknown, um, injection vectors which we aren't aware of yet. Um, so that's why, you know, we still have to pray a little bit. But at least we don't like build the whole system on on hope.",
      "timestamp_sec": 839,
      "talk_slug": "we-gave-an-agent-production-code-access-and-then-tried-to-sleep-at-night",
